# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Run artifacts
#
# Every pipeline writes under obs/. Posterior sample archives are ~2.3 GB each
# (17 of them, ~39 GB total), so nothing generated is tracked. Regenerate with
# the drivers listed in README.md.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
obs/
*.log
*.pickle
*.pkl
forward_validate/paper_roundtrip_outputs/

# real_data/obs/ also holds the experimental measurements. Re-admit those four
# arrays (24 MB): they are the only input here that cannot be regenerated.
!real_data/obs/
real_data/obs/*
!real_data/obs/I_meas_central.npy
!real_data/obs/I_ref_central.npy
!real_data/obs/angles.npy
!real_data/obs/steps.npy
